notes.content:
Hey, folks! We`re in halloween’s month, so, to celebrate it, we brought you an sexy and chilling update to you!

This update will give you an improved gameplay and more:


 Halloween`s theme;
 Graphic and GUI improvement;
 Animations;
 Cutscenes; 
 Audio effects upgrades;
 VFX refines;
 New Pause Menu;
 Best Personal score update;
 Difficulty levels rebalancing;
 Better achievements allocation,


And you still have a brand new game mode with a challenging character who claims its too self-sufficient. Watch out or she`ll freeze you!
